  "question": {
    "text": "A point <math><mtext>P</mtext></math>&nbsp;moves in a counter-clockwise direction on a circular path as shown in the figure. The movement of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>P</mtext></math> is such that it sweeps out a length <math><mtext>s</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math> where <math><mtext>s</mtext></math> is in metre and <math><mtext>t</mtext></math> is in seconds. The radius of the path is <math><mn>27&nbsp;</mn><mtext></mtext><mtext>m</mtext><mo>.</mo></math> The acceleration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>P</mtext></math> when <math><mtext>t</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></math> is ____ <math><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3.6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/965522fe-cf42-4e21-a133-8227b0e096f5.png\" style=\"width:1.97986in;height:1.90694in\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "32.40",
  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>c</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></msqrt></math><br />At <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>s</mi></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mro